<urn:atm:triage:finding/AO212-MIGRATE-F004>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AO212-MIGRATE-F004" ;
  triage:title "unattributed code path is dead; orphan files hard-crash instead of being recorded" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr QA-1 on PR #1014, ruthless-boundary-qa RBQA-F006 (verified): the 'unattributed' code path is dead. migrated_record() hardcodes unattributed=() and unattributed_count: 0; UnattributedEntry is never instantiated anywhere outside its own class definition. Every unclassifiable file hard-crashes via MigrationError instead of ever landing in 'unattributed', contradicting the sprint doc's explicit requirement that orphaned files either join a campaign or are recorded under unattributed with a reason. No test proves AC4's orphan-reachability requirement either." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ao2" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
